<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60668" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκλωψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ωπος</span> (acc.
			-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οπα</span>, v. infr.), ὁ, <u>Cyclops</u>, freq. in pl., oneeyed
		giant savages, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			9.106
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Th.</u>
			139
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Th.
			6.2
		</span></i>, etc.: prop. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Round-eyed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκλωπες δ᾽ ὄνομ᾽ ἦσαν ἐπώνυμον,
					οὕνεκ᾽ ἄρα σφέων κυκλοτερὴς ὀφθαλμὸς ἕεις
					ἐνέκειτο μετώπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					144
				</span></i>
			: hence as Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.
			σελήνη</span> the <i>round-eyed</i> moon, <i><span class="en">
				Parm.
				10.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλοπα κούρην</span>, of the
			pupil of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				84.8
			</span></i>: sg. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> always of <i><span class="en">
                    <u>Polyphemus</u>,
				1.69</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> mythical builders of prehistoric walls at
			Tiryns, Mycenae, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Hellanic.
				88
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecyd.
				12
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				35
			</span></i>(<i>a</i>) <i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				10.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				8.6.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυκλώπων βάθρα</span>, i.e. Mycenae,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				944
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκλωπες, οἱ</span>, a throw of the dice, <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				57.6
			</span></i>.</div>
